# Three-line intro to Fern and Scrolltown — for Jael (drafted 2026-11-07 23:09 CST; Will sends)

Meet Fern — she's eight, she lives inside the Great Scroll, and she's the neighbor who shows you around Scrolltown.
Scrolltown is the town inside the system where everyone keeps their own house-scroll, and every door opens only for its own key.
First episode is a mix-up at the post tower: no villains, just a sneeze, a lost story, and a little crew that's exactly enough together.
